{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/e12dc66fb2740190a28a1612afc00bc7.webp?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cYou call it a dungeon. I see a reflection of your soul. You build it from traps, monsters, and the shadows of your own fears. You leave the doors open, craving the blood of others. They will come for what you\u2019ve hidden \u2014 throwing themselves into fire, poison, and spikes to prove their strength. And you will enter their dungeons, knowing every step could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game. It is an endless exchange of deaths. And remember: in my world, there are no winners. Only those who died later.\u201d \u2014 The Entity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/fe60d9c3a15e44e4f09ffb2ed0484521.avif?t=1760575576\" width=617 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/55baf76bd68820064b049acf6f0f2c3a.webp?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/b2c1e606079420c01a3f9b9aff2f3859.avif?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dungeon is built from modules \u2014 rooms and corridors you connect into your own deadly labyrinth. Among them, two remain unchanged:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Entrance \u2014 the place where hope is born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/0dd711e49cfbe6c78cbe88defd8d4454.avif?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=335 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trove \u2014 where hope dies with everything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/6e63ad6ea0c991030a2547f96a06baa6.avif?t=1760575576\" width=617 height=335 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything between them belongs to you. Crossroads, dead ends, traps, and monsters \u2014 these are the tools with which you forge your fortress. Every step in this labyrinth is your design. And every soul that fails to reach the Trove will leave its reward to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/e6fbf1ce9bc700e714b025cbe2cf0028.webp?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you choose to enter a Raid, remember \u2014 there will be no maps, no hints. Only darkness, danger, and another\u2019s will waiting for your mistake. Every room will try to deceive you. Every trap will test your focus. Every monster will wait for you \u2014 and you alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/ba84ff9fd9b09e5b5e508b88f4e29f22.avif?t=1760575576\" width=617 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive \u2014 and you\u2019ll carry out the gold you craved. Die \u2014 and your soul will be left for others to claim. A Raid is just a game with only two wagers: either you take someone else\u2019s riches, or you lose your own life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/9a8acb8f30da0820065d11149cdade87.avif?t=1760575576\" width=617 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory in a raid is always more than just loot. It\u2019s a step toward making your own dungeon yield greater gold, and your soul grow stronger, wiser, and more enduring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/23e7f3854364ae6e74eed1996e376710.avif?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/54fdfe9a5ff39c9685622e3bc1ba2234.webp?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have gathered them for centuries \u2014 the greatest Tricksters who accepted my terms and dared the darkness. Their bodies now rest in my collection. Even in death they remember. Each Trickster holds a unique skill, a story, and a death that may feel closer to you \u2014 and certainly worthy of your attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/dc2c51c77e438eaed2c737fb5255b9f9.avif?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=331 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the dungeon overcomes you, you lose your body, your loot, and your progress. Only your soul remains, hungry for vengeance. Choose a new shell from my collection and continue the cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/88c87f4080ae9b6d0baea10fed877f6e.avif?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/6ccdf63d3f203914cc8ee791760cd6e1.webp?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unique characters are available, each with their own abilities, and five slots for character storage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dungeon using five modules with different threat levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect your dungeon, you have access to six traps and two monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available consumables include a sword, healing potion, bandage, and torch \u2014 they can be purchased from the Flickering Merchants or found during raids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Whirlpool of Treasures, you can store your loot \u2014 the demo provides one page with 32 slots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full gameplay loop is available: raid other players\u2019 dungeons, claim the best treasures, and strengthen your own lair.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version does not include character or dungeon progression, has limited consumables and tools, and additional abilities are disabled.<br>In the full release, all of these features \u2014 along with more traps, monsters, modules, and Tricksters \u2014 will be available.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060890?t=1760575576","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060890?t=1760575576","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/7781b774c523f7487a81dfa292b90ec08c96bb78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760575576","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/7781b774c523f7487a81dfa292b90ec08c96bb78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760575576","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages or for viewing at work"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/e12dc66fb2740190a28a1612afc00bc7.webp?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cYou call it a dungeon. I see a reflection of your soul. You build it from traps, monsters, and the shadows of your own fears. You leave the doors open, craving the blood of others. They will come for what you\u2019ve hidden \u2014 throwing themselves into fire, poison, and spikes to prove their strength. And you will enter their dungeons, knowing every step could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game. It is an endless exchange of deaths. And remember: in my world, there are no winners. Only those who died later.\u201d \u2014 The Entity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/fe60d9c3a15e44e4f09ffb2ed0484521.avif?t=1760575576\" width=617 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/55baf76bd68820064b049acf6f0f2c3a.webp?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/b2c1e606079420c01a3f9b9aff2f3859.avif?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dungeon is built from modules \u2014 rooms and corridors you connect into your own deadly labyrinth. Among them, two remain unchanged:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Entrance \u2014 the place where hope is born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/0dd711e49cfbe6c78cbe88defd8d4454.avif?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=335 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trove \u2014 where hope dies with everything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/6e63ad6ea0c991030a2547f96a06baa6.avif?t=1760575576\" width=617 height=335 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything between them belongs to you. Crossroads, dead ends, traps, and monsters \u2014 these are the tools with which you forge your fortress. Every step in this labyrinth is your design. And every soul that fails to reach the Trove will leave its reward to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/e6fbf1ce9bc700e714b025cbe2cf0028.webp?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you choose to enter a Raid, remember \u2014 there will be no maps, no hints. Only darkness, danger, and another\u2019s will waiting for your mistake. Every room will try to deceive you. Every trap will test your focus. Every monster will wait for you \u2014 and you alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/ba84ff9fd9b09e5b5e508b88f4e29f22.avif?t=1760575576\" width=617 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive \u2014 and you\u2019ll carry out the gold you craved. Die \u2014 and your soul will be left for others to claim. A Raid is just a game with only two wagers: either you take someone else\u2019s riches, or you lose your own life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/9a8acb8f30da0820065d11149cdade87.avif?t=1760575576\" width=617 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory in a raid is always more than just loot. It\u2019s a step toward making your own dungeon yield greater gold, and your soul grow stronger, wiser, and more enduring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/23e7f3854364ae6e74eed1996e376710.avif?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/54fdfe9a5ff39c9685622e3bc1ba2234.webp?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have gathered them for centuries \u2014 the greatest Tricksters who accepted my terms and dared the darkness. Their bodies now rest in my collection. Even in death they remember. Each Trickster holds a unique skill, a story, and a death that may feel closer to you \u2014 and certainly worthy of your attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/dc2c51c77e438eaed2c737fb5255b9f9.avif?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=331 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the dungeon overcomes you, you lose your body, your loot, and your progress. Only your soul remains, hungry for vengeance. Choose a new shell from my collection and continue the cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/88c87f4080ae9b6d0baea10fed877f6e.avif?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060890/extras/6ccdf63d3f203914cc8ee791760cd6e1.webp?t=1760575576\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unique characters are available, each with their own abilities, and five slots for character storage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dungeon using five modules with different threat levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect your dungeon, you have access to six traps and two monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available consumables include a sword, healing potion, bandage, and torch \u2014 they can be purchased from the Flickering Merchants or found during raids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Whirlpool of Treasures, you can store your loot \u2014 the demo provides one page with 32 slots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full gameplay loop is available: raid other players\u2019 dungeons, claim the best treasures, and strengthen your own lair.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version does not include character or dungeon progression, has limited consumables and tools, and additional abilities are disabled.<br>In the full release, all of these features \u2014 along with more traps, monsters, modules, and Tricksters \u2014 will be available.</p>","developers":["Gamirare Inc."],"fullgame":{"appid":"3077850","nam